{"id":"amistad","lemma":"amistad","pos":"noun","rank":1454,"glosses":["friendship"],"ipa":"/amisˈtad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"amistades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-amistad.wav","examples":[{"text":"Creo en la amistad.","en":"I believe in friendship.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639162"},{"text":"No olvido a mis amistades.","en":"I don't forget my friends."},{"text":"Nuestra amistad no duró.","en":"Our friendship did not last.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/641791"},{"text":"Una fiesta es un buen lugar para hacer amistades.","en":"A party is a good place to make friends with other people."},{"text":"La verdadera amistad es invaluable.","en":"True friendship is priceless.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/64557"}]}